    - '*':
        reason: "Deferred: fixed only in starlette >=1.x, which needs a FastAPI 0.115->0.141 major upgrade (separate tested change). Low practical risk on a localhost single-user, non-internet-exposed API (DoS/SSRF/ReDoS)."
        expires: 2026-11-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-PYTHON-STARLETTE-8186175:
    - '*':
        reason: "Deferred: fixed only in starlette >=1.x, which needs a FastAPI 0.115->0.141 major upgrade (separate tested change). Low practical risk on a localhost single-user, non-internet-exposed API (DoS/SSRF/ReDoS)."
        expires: 2026-11-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-PYTHON-TRANSFORMERS-14560695:
    - '*':
        reason: "CVE-2025-14926 (ZDI-25-1147): code injection in the SEW checkpoint converter's convert_config. No fixed version (Snyk, checked 2026-11-07; vendor rejected the report). The app does not load only its own models: backend/data/finbert_scorer.py loads third-party pretrained ProsusAI/finbert (BERT) weights from the Hugging Face Hub by a constant name, without trust_remote_code. It never converts checkpoints or loads the affected model family. The installed 5.6.2 wheel does not ship the SEW conversion script. Review due 2026-11-23; see docs/SECURITY.md."
        expires: 2026-11-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-PYTHON-TRANSFORMERS-14563374:
    - '*':
        reason: "CVE-2025-14930 (ZDI-25-1145): deserialization when parsing GLM4 weights. No fixed version (Snyk, checked 2026-11-07; vendor rejected the report). The app does not load only its own models: backend/data/finbert_scorer.py loads third-party pretrained ProsusAI/finbert (BERT) weights from the Hugging Face Hub by a constant name, without trust_remote_code. It never converts checkpoints or loads the affected model family. The installed 5.6.2 wheel ships no GLM4 conversion script. Review due 2026-11-23; see docs/SECURITY.md."
        expires: 2026-11-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-PYTHON-TRANSFORMERS-14564275:
    - '*':
        reason: "CVE-2025-14929 (ZDI-25-1144): deserialization in X-CLIP checkpoint conversion. No fixed version (Snyk, checked 2026-11-07; vendor rejected the report). The app does not load only its own models: backend/data/finbert_scorer.py loads third-party pretrained ProsusAI/finbert (BERT) weights from the Hugging Face Hub by a constant name, without trust_remote_code. It never converts checkpoints or loads the affected model family. The installed 5.6.2 wheel does not ship the X-CLIP conversion script. Review due 2026-11-23; see docs/SECURITY.md."
        expires: 2026-11-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-PYTHON-TRANSFORMERS-14564363:
    - '*':
        reason: "CVE-2025-14924 (ZDI-25-1141): deserialization when parsing megatron_gpt2 checkpoints. No fixed version (Snyk, checked 2026-11-07; vendor rejected the report). The app does not load only its own models: backend/data/finbert_scorer.py loads third-party pretrained ProsusAI/finbert (BERT) weights from the Hugging Face Hub by a constant name, without trust_remote_code. It never converts checkpoints or loads the affected model family. The installed 5.6.2 megatron_gpt2 reshaping script is a CLI tool the app never imports, and it loads with weights_only=True. Review due 2026-11-23; see docs/SECURITY.md."
        expires: 2026-11-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-PYTHON-TRANSFORMERS-14564364:
    - '*':
        reason: "CVE-2025-14928 (ZDI-25-1146): code injection in the HuBERT checkpoint converter's convert_config. No fixed version (Snyk, checked 2026-11-07; vendor rejected the report). The app does not load only its own models: backend/data/finbert_scorer.py loads third-party pretrained ProsusAI/finbert (BERT) weights from the Hugging Face Hub by a constant name, without trust_remote_code. It never converts checkpoints or loads the affected model family. The installed 5.6.2 wheel does not ship the HuBERT conversion script. Review due 2026-11-23; see docs/SECURITY.md."
        expires: 2026-11-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-PYTHON-TRANSFORMERS-14564365:
    - '*':
        reason: "CVE-2025-14921 (ZDI-25-1149): deserialization when parsing Transformer-XL model files. No fixed version (Snyk, checked 2026-11-07; vendor rejected the report). The app does not load only its own models: backend/data/finbert_scorer.py loads third-party pretrained ProsusAI/finbert (BERT) weights from the Hugging Face Hub by a constant name, without trust_remote_code. It never converts checkpoints or loads the affected model family. The installed 5.6.2 package has no Transformer-XL model code. Review due 2026-11-23; see docs/SECURITY.md."
        expires: 2026-11-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-PYTHON-TRANSFORMERS-14564366:
    - '*':
        reason: "CVE-2025-14927 (ZDI-25-1148): code injection in the SEW-D checkpoint converter's convert_config. No fixed version (Snyk, checked 2026-11-07; vendor rejected the report). The app does not load only its own models: backend/data/finbert_scorer.py loads third-party pretrained ProsusAI/finbert (BERT) weights from the Hugging Face Hub by a constant name, without trust_remote_code. It never converts checkpoints or loads the affected model family. The installed 5.6.2 wheel does not ship the SEW-D conversion script. Review due 2026-11-23; see docs/SECURITY.md."
        expires: 2026-11-30T00:00:00.000Z
